# Optimisation run outputs. Every run writes a GEMSEO history (.hdf) and a full model
# dump (.json); the sweeps in this folder come to roughly 215 MB, all of it regenerable
# by the drivers sitting beside it. What is committed instead is the analysis: the CSVs
# carry every number the figures and the reports quote.
results/
results_e/
results_prefix/
results_tight/

# Solver logs. Kept so a sweep in progress can be watched, not as a record of it.
logs/
log_*.txt
